  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ChinorBC Phase 2 Methane &#x2013; Project Development Workshop</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Pre-Project&#x2019;s main activity is to conduct a workshop between NEA and CRAES in Beijing on 25-29 September 2023, with the objective to develop and finalize the project application for the second phase of the Black Carbon Project, CHN-2148,19-0029. The second phase will focus on helping China develop sound policies and actions to control methane emissions, another most significant short-lived climate pollutant next to black carbon.</narrative>
  </description>
